Subject: [PATCH] [vero5] Opt-in poster CPU/upload edge diagnostics

Diagnostic-only instrumentation for Kodi 21.3 a3a448d plus the current
all/arm/vero5 patch series (including edge clamp fix 912).
An exact local image path in special://temp/texture-edge-diagnostics.conf
enables three raw snapshots per load and bounded draw/upload metadata.
No texture contents, scaling or sampling parameters are changed.
Raw captures are limited to 20 loads and 128 MiB per process session.
No output is produced without the config file. See tools/texture-edge-diagnostics.

